⚡🇪🇹 The Ethiopian Foreign Ministry releases a statement that the construction of the Egyptian High Dam was negative and led to wide social disturbances in Ethiopia.

It is unknown if Khat shipments were increased in recent weeks, for how the construction of a dam in Egypt, a downstream country, led to harmful effects thousands of kilometers away to a country where the Nile originates from still alludes me.

